# 4-plate fixture for P3 rotation-source seam tests (fantasim-app-godot)
# PLATES4 format: MovingPlateId TimeMa PoleLatDeg PoleLonDeg AngleDeg FixedPlateId
# Plates 1-4 are each fixed to plate 0 (the anchor). Keyframes at 0, 4, 8 Ma so SLERP
# interpolation between them yields smoothly varying per-tick rotations. At 0 Ma every
# plate is identity (angle 0), so onset (= present) maps to no rotation and the sampler's
# incremental rotation equals the interpolated total rotation.
1 0.0 90.0 0.0 0.0 0
1 4.0 90.0 0.0 6.0 0
1 8.0 90.0 0.0 12.0 0
2 0.0 0.0 90.0 0.0 0
2 4.0 0.0 90.0 10.0 0
2 8.0 0.0 90.0 20.0 0
3 0.0 -45.0 180.0 0.0 0
3 4.0 -45.0 180.0 -8.0 0
3 8.0 -45.0 180.0 -16.0 0
4 0.0 45.0 90.0 0.0 0
4 4.0 45.0 90.0 14.0 0
4 8.0 45.0 90.0 28.0 0
